## Agent safety

For any task touching LLM agents, tool calling, MCP tools, agent loops, sandboxing,
prompt injection, limits, approvals, or evals, use the `safe-agent-harness` skill
(`.claude/skills/safe-agent-harness/SKILL.md`). Follow its routing table and end with
its exit checklist. Slash commands: /new-agent /add-tool /harden /audit /review-pr /evals /debug-trace
